// Mule's loadout (openspec/changes/signature-weapons; survey G20, owner, 2026-10-26: "Approve all"). Hand-tuned:
// tools/mechs/gen_mech_data.py writes mule.ron and leaves this file alone. The signature weapon is first and
// starred on the WEAPONS page. Speeds m/s, intervals s, penetration mm, blast MJ, heat a share of the weapon heat
// bank (a shot, or a second of beam), which cools from full in 20 s (survey G23). Starting numbers: playtests tune them.
// The rocket ripple: sixteen dumbfire rockets in 1.9 s from the shoulder pods, each aim scattered 0.6 degrees, on F.
(
    weapons: [
        (name: "rocket ripple", socket: "ROCKET_R", arm: Torso, group: 2, speed_m_s: 240.0, interval_s: 12.0,
         penetration_mm: 120.0, damage: 30.0, blast_mj: 2.0, kind: Rocket, signature: true,
         burst: Some((count: 16, gap_s: 0.125, jitter_deg: 0.6))),
        (name: "35 mm autocannon", socket: "MUZZLE_R", arm: ArmR, group: 0, speed_m_s: 1100.0, interval_s: 0.12,
         penetration_mm: 90.0, damage: 12.0, blast_mj: 0.4),
        (name: "35 mm autocannon", socket: "MUZZLE_L", arm: ArmL, group: 1, speed_m_s: 1100.0, interval_s: 0.12,
         penetration_mm: 90.0, damage: 12.0, blast_mj: 0.4),
    ],
    weapon_heat: (recharge_s: 20.0, relight_heat: 0.4),
)
